==Trivia==
*Most earning organization of 2024 (Total Winnings: $1,053,872). <ref>{{cite web|url=https://liquipedia.net/valorant/Statistics/2024|title=Statistics 2024|date=2024-12-31|author=[[Liquipedia]]}}</ref>
*First Chinese organization to reach 1 million {{Abbr/USD}} in earnings.
*First Chinese organization to win Champions.
*Was the first Chinese representative at a [[VCT/2022/Champions|Champions]] event while the game was yet to be approved in the country.
*In 2023, both '''EDward Gaming''' and [[Chao Hui EDward Gaming]] almost won all their regional VCT events. [[Chao Hui EDward Gaming]] placed second in [[VCT/2023/Game_Changers/China/Qualifier|VCT 2023: GC China Qualifier]], but still qualified to [[VCT/2023/Game_Changers/East_Asia|VCT 2023: Game Changers East Asia]] which they also won.
*'''EDward Gaming''' won all 3 China Evolution Series Acts in 2023 ([[China_Evolution_Series/2023/Act_1|Act 1]], [[China_Evolution_Series/2023/Act_2|Act 2]] and [[China_Evolution_Series/2023/Act_3|Act 3]]) as well as all 3 VCT China events in 2024. ([[VCT/2024/China_League/Kickoff|Kickoff]], [[VCT/2024/China_League/Stage_1|Stage 1]] and [[VCT/2024/China_League/Stage_2|Stage 2]])
*They are the first Chinese organization to win an international event, that being [[VCT/2024/Champions|VALORANT Champions 2024]].
*During [[VCT/2025/China League/Kickoff|Kickoff 2025]], between the Lower Bracket Quarterfinals series against [[Xi Lai Gaming]] and the Lower Bracket Semifinals series against [[Dragon Ranger Gaming]], '''EDward Gaming''' ammassed a win streak of 32 consecutive rounds, inclusive of 2 13-0 wins on ''Haven'', setting a VCT Record for most number of consecutive rounds won by a team.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://x.com/valesports_cn/status/1882420875343118446|title=Congratulations to @EDG_Edward for breaking the record in VCT with 32 round win streak!!!|author=Valorant Champions Tour CN|date=2025-01-23|language={{flag|usuk}} English}}</ref>

